        <comment location="R16Unorm">
            <summary>Red channel only. 16 bit integer per channel. [0, 65535] converted to/from float [0, 1] in shader. <see cref="WebGpuSharp.FeatureName.TextureFormat16BitNorm"/> must be enabled to use this texture format.</summary>
        </comment>
        <comment location="R16Snorm">
            <summary>Red channel only. 16 bit integer per channel. [0, 65535] converted to/from float [-1, 1] in shader. <see cref="WebGpuSharp.FeatureName.TextureFormat16BitNorm"/> must be enabled to use this texture format.</summary>
        </comment>
        <comment location="RG16Unorm">
            <summary>Red and green channels. 16 bit integer per channel. [0, 65535] converted to/from float [0, 1] in shader. <see cref="WebGpuSharp.FeatureName.TextureFormat16BitNorm"/> must be enabled to use this texture format.</summary>
        </comment>
        <comment location="RG16Snorm">
            <summary>Red and green channels. 16 bit integer per channel. [0, 65535] converted to/from float [-1, 1] in shader. <see cref="WebGpuSharp.FeatureName.TextureFormat16BitNorm"/> must be enabled to use this texture format.</summary>
        </comment>
        <comment location="R64Uint">
            <summary>Red channel only. 64 bit integer per channel. Unsigned in shader. <see cref="WebGpuSharp.FeatureName.TextureInt64Atomic"/> must be enabled to use this texture format.</summary>
        </comment>
        <comment location="RGBA16Unorm">
            <summary>Red, green, blue, and alpha channels. 16 bit integer per channel. [0, 65535] converted to/from float [0, 1] in shader. <see cref="WebGpuSharp.FeatureName.TextureFormat16BitNorm"/> must be enabled to use this texture format.</summary>
