        </comment>
        <comment location="NV12">
            <summary>YUV 4:2:0 chroma subsampled format. Contains two planes: 0: Single 8 bit channel luminance. 1: Dual 8 bit channel chrominance at half width and half height. Valid view formats for luminance are <see cref="WebGpuSharp.TextureFormat.R8Unorm"/>. Valid view formats for chrominance are <see cref="WebGpuSharp.TextureFormat.Rg8Unorm"/>. Width and height must be even. <see cref="WebGpuSharp.FeatureName.TextureFormatNv12"/> must be enabled to use this texture format.</summary>
        </comment>
    </group>
</group>